'''The 3rd Dimension''' (絶・絶望新次元 ''Zetsu・Zetsubō Shin Jigen'', '''Absolute・New Despair Dimension''') is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 8.7 Update|Version 8.7]] and appears every Sunday. It is unlocked after clearing [[The Wormhole Opens (Deadly)|The 2nd Dimension]]. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first completed, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Volley Cat (Rare Cat)|Volley Cat]] - Curry Cat.

